window.products.push({"id":610246,"name":"Aromatherapy Essential Oil Diffuser 550ml, Aroma Diffusers for Home Small Room with Auto Power-Off  4 Timers and 7 Color Lights, Personal Desk Ultraso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c1J5sETtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Remote Controll & Auto Power-off: The Aromatherapy essential oils diffusers are designed with auto power-off function and also it can be controlled by remote controller, It is convenient for adults and kids to use. Our air aroma diffuser includes 7 ambient LED lighting with Dim and Bright modes, you can set it as color changes dynamically and cyclically, or set it as one fixed color, or turn on/off the light separately as you wish 550ML Tank Capacity: Our Otheya essential oil aroma difuser feature 550ml capacity, can work for 6 hours to 8 hours in strong mist mode and 10 hr to 12 hours in weak mist mode. Great electric Aromatherapy diffuser for room of 10 - 30 square meters. This oil defusers works well to disseminate the aroma steam to your small room. It is suitable for apartments, office, studio, children and babies rooms and large room office Timer and Mist Control: Our Aromatherapy diffusers have 4 timers sets: 1 hour, 3 hours, 6 hours and continuous on. When the set time is up or water is used up, the mist diffusers will turn off automatically. You can combine mist modes as you like Ultrasonic Mist Humidifier: Our humidifiers are made of plastic materials with wooden grain, With ultrasonic technology, room diffuser works extremely quiet (Below 35 dB).The cool air humidifier will make you relax and help to improve breathing and sleeping, relieve allergy, reduce static electricity shocks in the dry climate Wonderful Gifts:  Otheya Aromatherapy difuser for essential oils is modern design with gift package box.it is the best gift for your friends and family, it can be a wonderful home decor for daily life. This air aroma diffuser is nice for bedroom, living room, yoga room, kids room and reading room","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c1J5sETtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Otheya","source_asin":"B09XXB23F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXB23F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXB23F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
