window.products.push({"id":610307,"name":"Notorious R.B.G. Ruth Bader Ginsburg Ceramic Coffee Mug Tea Cup Fun Novelty Gift 12 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gN6EK8uiL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"DURABLE COFFEE MUG - The coffee mug cup is made of ceramic and not your ordinary coffee mug. You will definitely like the feel of the mug in your hands as it is sturdy but had a wonderful shape to fit comfortably wrap your hands around it and it holds a perfect amount of tea coffee of more than 11 OZ. The handle is very durable and allows for easy drinking. The color of this coffee cup is vibrant with a good size and a stylish design which holds up well in the dishwasher. HIGH QUALITY USA MUG PRINTING - This premium grade coffee mug cup is professionally printed in the USA with fade resistant, non-toxic inks. Our ceramic mugs are decorated on both sides so right handed or left handed users can enjoy them equally. All mugs are fired at over 350 degrees to ensure each white coffee mug will last a long time without scratching or fading like a normal cup. EVERYONE LOVES MUG GIFTS - Treat dad to a mug for fathers day or get mom a mug for mothers day. Women and men love a mug gift. Get a funny coffee mug or gag gift for friends or a boss or coworker from the office. Get a cat mug or a dog mug for an animal lover. Use it as a tea mug or a cocoa mug and stay cozy with a warmer drink all winter. Or make it a wine mug or beer mug in the summer. BIRTHDAY and HOLIDAY PRESENTS - Go big this Christmas holiday and give this gift your mom, dad, daughter, sister, brother, boyfriend, girlfriend, husband, wife, male or female office coworkers, daughter, grandpa, grandma, grandson. granddaughter, teacher or your best friends for their birthday, graduation, wedding, or any other occasion for cool novelty gifts. Celebrate the legacy of the Notorious RBG and say I Dissent with this Ruth Bader Ginsberg poster. This RBG mug, poster, or framed art make perfect women empowerment gifts. Supreme Court justice RBG inspired generations with her work towards gender equality and became a feminist icon. Shes had books, movies and documentaries made about her and her image is popular on gifts like dolls and bobbleheads","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gN6EK8uiL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Foundry","source_asin":"B07BDLH2H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BDLH2H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BDLH2H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
