window.products.push({"id":610385,"name":"simpletome Electric Toothbrush Holder for Shower Hanging Toothbrush Razor Toothpaste Wall Mounted Hanger Bathroom Storage Organizer (Lovely Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WfqokMYOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO DAMAGE TO WALL : The product is attached with 2PCS SUPER STRONG acrylic self-adhesive waterproof back tapes ( with 1PCS extra adhesive hanger in the box for backup or trial ), suction wall type suspension, protect the wall without leaving traces, save your Bathroom space. KEEP TOOTHBRUSH CLEAN & DRY : simpletome adhesive electric toothbrush holder is made of waterproof plastic. There are drain holes at the bottom. It can Keep the bottom of your electric toothbrush dry, and then you don't have to worry about stagnant water any more. Multi-functional Toothbrush Holder: A set of products contains ①3 ADJUSTABLE TOOTHBRUSH HOLDERS for electric toothbrush, toothpaste, facial cleanser and shaver. ②ORGANIZER BOX,can place your comb, manual toothbrush, electric shaver, makeup brush. ③2 ADJUSTABLE HOOKS FOR RAZOR HOLDER(with the adjustable arms, it can fit 100% razor in the market). ④FOUR HOOKS WITH SAFETY BLOCK-You can hang your hair bands, necklaces, watches, cleaning brushes, shaving brushes, towels when you take the shower. ABOUT SIZE & DAILY USE : Perfect size for your daily life. Length 10.63inch/27cm, width 5.9inch/15cm, Distance from wall 2.36inch/6cm. The holder fits perfectly in bathroom vanity top and countertops, help you much easier to get access to your toothbrush and other small objects everyday. Save your bathroom space and make it orderly, tidy and clean. IMPORTANT TIPS : ① It Works very well on most SMOOTH and FLAT surface, which MUST BE no powder, water, dust and oil. It works perfectly on Wood, Ceramic tile, Glasses, Marble, Metal Surface. (NOT FIT for wall papers wall) ② It can be removed with hair dryer to blow the tape for 3-5 minutes to make it warm , then remove it with an art knife,without leaving any residual glue. ③ Please press it hard for about 15-30 seconds when installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WfqokMYOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"simpletome","source_asin":"B091C9G8R4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091C9G8R4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091C9G8R4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
