window.products.push({"id":610514,"name":"HARSEVA Electric Standing Desk 23x 47 - Motorized, Ergonomic Workstation for Home Office, Study, Gaming - 28.7-46.4\" Height Adjustable Table, USB Port","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y8h6FghwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your back hurt after sitting and working all day long? After enjoying your morning coffee, you’re all perked up to work and get things done on your computer. Just a few hours into the day, however, you feel your back, neck, and shoulders starting to ache, making it hard for you to focus on your tasks for the day. Whenever you feel your back getting sore, you get out of your seat and stretch your muscles. After stretching them out, you sit yourself down, get back to work, and slowly feel your back ache again. The cycle just goes on the whole day. Perhaps it’s time to invest in your comfort at this point. The HARSEVA Electric Standing Desk is a smart upgrade for your workstation. Get more things done with the help of our electric standing desk. It’s run by a dual motor that lets you adjust the height of the desk from 28.7\" to 46.4\" with just a push of a button. No need to deal with clunky screws or manual levers to set the perfect table height! A messy workspace can be a cause of stress and frustration. Our standing desk comes with three built-in USB ports plus a wireless charging dock, keeping your table space organized. No more tangled cords or bunched-up cables. The table's surface is protected by 5mm tempered glass that shields against scuffs, scratches, or high temperatures. This tabletop stands on a solid frame made of powder-coated steel, giving it a maximum weight capacity of up to 264lbs. Need more time to decide? Here are more reasons to replace your desk with this smart table: ✅ Lets you save up to 4 different height settings ✅ Touch screen controls with security lock feature ✅ With pull-out drawer for everyday essentials ✅ Comes with non-slip standing desk mat, coasters, phone holder  ✅ Cable management organizer included Enjoy all-day working comfort. Add the HARSEVA Electric Standing Desk to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y8h6FghwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HARSEVA","source_asin":"B095W6VGS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095W6VGS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095W6VGS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
