window.products.push({"id":610627,"name":"Wedding Wine Charms - Magnetic Stemless Glass Markers - Set of 6 by Simply Charmed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AV+lxXR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Surprise the bride on the day of her wedding or bridal shower with this lovely set of wedding wine glass charms that can be used at the reception for the celebratory first champagne toast. No matter what kind of glasses the bride and groom choose, whether they are stemless champagne flutes, crystal wine glasses or even lovely water glasses, these magnetic glass markers will serve to decorate and embellish them. They charms attach through the glass with two strong magnets and stay put until removed. The 6 charms, which include a dove, three variations of heart charms, a champagne bottle and wedding bells, can be used in the future for everyday, anniversaries, or to decorate an album page or photo frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AV+lxXR3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Charmed","source_asin":"B01BMY4OHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BMY4OHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BMY4OHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":610628,"name":"IEKA 20-Piece Flatware Set,Stainless Steel Mirror Polishing tableware, Multipurpose Use for Home Kitchen or Restaurant, Cutlery Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617DUgXNI-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The IEKA 20 Piece Flatware Dining Set is sturdy enough to stand up to everyday use but also beautiful enough to grace the fanciest table. We worked hard to design a flatware set that gives you all the features you want at an affordable price It is both peaceful and beautiful in its simplicity. Due to its understated appearance and discreet elegance, the cutlery is a harmonious addition to a modern decor. It coordinates with single-coloured crockery as well as with bright patterns, and can be combined in a variety of ways. Stylistic features: Modern length with balanced proportions.  Carefully rounded edges for a pleasant feel.  Can be combined in a variety of ways.  stainless steel that will never rust  Dishwasher safe Daily use of your Flatware keeps each piece bright and shiny. Below are some general guidelines to help you care for your sterling silver flatware: After each use, promptly wash or rinse your flatware with hot water and dry it. If you hand-wash your flatware, use a mild detergent. Do not leave your flatware sitting in water, as soaking can permanently damage the metal.  Keep flatware and stainless steel flatware in separate baskets in the dishwasher.  If you put the flatware in the dishwasher, keep detergent to a minimum, remove the flatware from the dishwasher before the dry cycle, and then dry items completely with a soft towel. Make sure your flatware is completely dry before you store it.  If using daily: Store flatware in a moisture-free drawer.  Do not wrap your flatware in rubber bands, plastic or newspaper, or in any material with a high sulphur content.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617DUgXNI-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IEKA","source_asin":"B01LY2QC3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LY2QC3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LY2QC3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
