window.products.push({"id":610668,"name":"Pop Top Food Storage Container with Airtight Rubber Seal and Push Button Locking Cover, Unique Lid Hook and Bonus Scoop, 1 quartz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+juzf5unL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lock in the freshness and say goodbye to stalewe all know air is the enemy of food. Leaving dry goods exposed causes them to oxidize and they quickly become stale. Plus, the scent from unsealed food containers can attract household pests like mice and ants. Eliminate the pests and say goodbye to stale with these handy pop, top food containers by ankou.About this product, one touch open and close, airtight seal preserves freshness and prevents leaks, easy, grip lid hangs on container, durable, clear plastic, so you can see insideavailable in 10 sizes,.9 qt (scoop included) , 1 qt (scoop included) , 1.7 qt (scoop included) , 1.8 qt (scoop included) , 2.11 qt, 2.23 qt (scoop included) , 2.5 qt, 2.65 qt, 3.1 qt, 3.6 qt, 4.0 qtkeeping food fresh just got easierit's time to throw out those chip, bag clips and unwieldy vacuum sealers. With ankou one touch is all you need to seal in the freshness and lock in the flavor. Press the button once for an airtight seal, press again to release. It's simple, yet incredibly effective.Our innovative design features a durable silicone gasket that instantly forms an air tight seal, so food stays fresh for longer and liquids don't leak. Plus, the easy, stack design and clear sides make organizing your kitchen a breeze. Mix and match your stack and see at a glance which items need to be restocked. The easy, grip lids hang from the side of the container when not in use, so you won't lose them.These handy containers aren't just for food either. They can be used to organize and store medications, small toys, craft supplies, spare parts and more.At ankou we're serious about freshness, and we take pride in making quality household items that will make your everyday life a little bit easier. Please let us know if we can be of any assistance. And of course, please let us know if you love your ankou pop, top containers as much as we do.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+juzf5unL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ankou","source_asin":"B0744KSK42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0744KSK42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0744KSK42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
