window.products.push({"id":610766,"name":"NOLTSE Electric Can Opener, Battery Can Opener, Electric Can Opener Smooth Edge, A button to Open Your Cans, Portable Can Opener Electric Kitchen for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnPGu-HQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Electric Can Opener One key to start and stop at any time, the electric can opener will automatically open your cans within 30 seconds. Small but powerful, it can open any size lid, whether it is small, medium or large-and it is cut from the side, so it does not leave sharp edges. Feature: ♥Powerful function, suitable for most can sizes, electric can opener is easy to use. ♥Open the can in 30 seconds, powered by 2*AA batteries. (Not included) ♥Suitable for human hand design, compact size and one hand can be used for easy storage. ♥ No sharp edges, no more sharp edges and wrist problems-children can use it safely. Operate: Step 1-Place the can opener on the can with its edge in the groove between the cutter and the drive wheel Step2-Place the can on a flat surface, press and hold the button for about 2 seconds and then release, the can opener will start to cut the sides of the can Step3-After the cutting is completed, the can opener will automatically stop, and then remove the can opener from the can. Step4-If the lid of the can is stuck, immediately press the button at the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter. The cutter will rotate in the opposite direction and the lid will fall off. Troubleshooting 1. If the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the jar. Slide the battery cover back and replace the 2 AA batteries. The can opener should continue to cut. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Jars with heavy seams and uneven edges may stop the can opener. Immediately press the button at the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter, the cutter will rotate in the opposite direction, and then you can remove the can of the can opener and restart it. 3. If the can is stuck, press the button at the end of the can opener to reverse the cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dnPGu-HQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOLTSE","source_asin":"B09STWTKPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09STWTKPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09STWTKPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
