window.products.push({"id":610893,"name":"TENBOOM Wood Stove Fan, 4 Blades Heat Powered Stove Fan Fireplace Fan,Quiet Motor, Circulating Warm Air Saving Fuel, Non Electric for Log Burner/Wood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mI0ry55FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ESSENTIAL STOVE ACCESSORIES: The wood stove fan can be placed on any surface of a particle stove, wooden stove, stove, or stove heater. It can blow the warm air above the stove to the living area, increase indoor warm air circulation, and help the indoor temperature rise rapidly, uniformly, and stably. WHISPER-QUIET: Our stove fan uses thermometric technology to convert the temperature difference into electrical energy to drive the motor and then rotate the blades without the need for batteries or electricity. Improve indoor warm air circulation, bring greater comfort and reduce the wood consumption of the stove. When the fireplace fan is working, the sound is lower than 25 dB, which is very quiet, and you can hardly feel it working. OPERATING TEMPERATURE: The operating temperature range of the fireplace fan is about 40°C-400°C (104 °F-752 °F), and the optimum range is 85 °C-400 °C (185 °F-752 °F). The speed of the stove fan depends on the temperature of the stove. The higher the temperature, the faster the speed is. If the wood stove fan does not turn in time after reaching the operating temperature, please wear protective gloves, and then move the blade gently, without touching it directly with your hands. SAFETY DESIGN: The fireplace fan is treated with anodized aluminum, which can resist high temperatures up to 752 °F (400 °C) and will not deform even if it works at a high temperature for a long time. A metal safety device is installed on the base. If the maximum temperature is exceeded, the safety device will slightly lift the front part of the wood stove fan to protect the motor. PROFESSIONAL SERVICE: Please read the user guide carefully before using heat powered stove fan. If you still have any problems during use, please feel free to contact us and we will help you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mI0ry55FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TENBOOM","source_asin":"B09N91B37Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N91B37Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N91B37Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
