window.products.push({"id":610965,"name":"Etekcity Food Kitchen Bowl Scale, Digital Ounces and Grams, 11lb/5kg, Backlit Display & Smart Scale for Body Weight, Bluetooth Electronic Body Composi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tE1F8gD6L._SL1001_.jpg","description":"Etekcity Food Kitchen Bowl Scale, Digital Ounces and Grams for Cooking, Baking, Meal Prep, Dieting, and Weight Loss, 11lb/5kg, Backlit Display1. Simply Accurate With a weight capacity of 11 pounds (5 kilograms) and graduation of 0.1 ounces (1 gram), this Etekcity digital kitchen scale has the accuracy to meet your personal and commercial needs. The compact and lightweight design makes it ideal for homes, kitchens, offices, mailrooms, and more. The scale clearly displays measurement results in g, lb: oz, fl' oz, and ml on the digital LCD display the instant any weight is applied. 2. Removable Bowl Design The digital scale was designed with a removable bowl, great for measuring mixed ingredients and tare measurements. When not in use, the bowl can be flipped upside down and placed over the scale unit to be used as a protective case, making it easy to store without taking up too much space. 3. Automatic Convenience Save energy and save time. The auto-zero and tare functions are featured for accuracy when weighing items individually or in containers. After 2 minutes of inactivity, the digital scale will trigger the auto-off function, prolonging the battery lifespan. It also provides low battery and overload indications. Save energy and simplify your life without lifting a finger. 4. Specifications Max. Weight: 11lb/5kg Division: 0.1oz /1g /1ml Measurement: lb: oz/ g / ml / fl'oz Modes: Weight / Milk / Water Bowl/Storage Dimensions: 8.66 x 6.89 x 2.04 in (L x W x H) Usage Dimensions: 8.66 x 6.89 x 3.54 in (L x W x H) Weight: 16.39oz Package Contents: 1 x Digital Kitchen Scale 1 x Removable bowl 2 x 1.5V AAA batteries(Pre-installed) 1 x Quick Start Guide.Etekcity Smart Scale for Body Weight, Accurate Digital Bathroom Weighing Machine with Body Fat Percentage Water Muscle BMI for People, Bluetooth Electronic Body Composition Monitors, 400lb1. Gain insight into your overall body composition with 13 fitness biometrics such as Body Fat, BMI and Muscle Mass. 2. Open the app and step onto the scale. Within seconds, your measurements sync with your VeSync account. 3. Specifictions: (1) Pruduct Size: 11x11x1.1 in. (2) Weight Unit: lb/ kg/ St (switch the unit via VeSync app). (3) Weight Capacity: 400 lb/180 kg/28 st. (4) Increments: 0.05lb/0.02 kg (100g≤m≤10kg) and 0.1lb/0.05 kg（10kg＜m≤180kg). (5) Auto-Off: 5/10/30 seconds. 4. Package Contents: 1xSmart Fitness Scale, 3x1.5V AAA Batteries (Pre-Installed), 1xQuick Start Guide. 5.This scale uses a harmless electrical current to measure body fat. Consult a healthcare professional before using the smart scale if you use medical electronic equipment such as a pacemaker, or you can turn on its thoughtful Zero-Current Mode to measure weight and BMI only. 6.Please note this scale is not intended for use by professional athletes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tE1F8gD6L._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Etekcity","source_asin":"B09TBM4ZZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-610965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TBM4ZZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TBM4ZZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
